**3. Node Operator Workflow Verification**

| Trigger Action | Pi Desktop / SoloHost Execution | Result |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **X570 Build Push**[cite: 1] | Developer pushes `latest` tag digest to Docker Hub[cite: 1, 4]. | Upstream digest updated on registry[cite: 1, 4]. |
| **SoloHost App Restart** | Operator clicks **Stop** and **Start** in SoloHost UI[cite: 1]. | SoloHost detects newer digest via `pull_policy: always`, downloads new layers, and recreates the container on port 3000 automatically[cite: 1, 4]. |
| **Data Persistence** | Container mounts to host gateway `27017`[cite: 1, 4]. | Node restarts into `CONNECTED` / `HEALTHY` state without data wiping[cite: 4]. |